{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","title":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2810,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:gram-schmidt-bilin-nonvanishing]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","line":4788,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Nonvanishing of the Fibrewise Denominators]\n\\label{lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame, def:local-nondegenerate-family, lem:gram-schmidt-bilin-nonvanishing, lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product}\n\n\n\n\nIf $(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)$ is nondegenerate on $u$, then\n\\[\ng_x(U_j|_x,U_j|_x)\\ne0\n\\qquad(x\\in u).\n\\]\n\\end{lemma}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:gram-schmidt-bilin-nonvanishing,lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product}\n\\sketch Apply Lemma \\ref{lem:gram-schmidt-bilin-nonvanishing} in each scalar\nproduct space $(V_x,g_x)$ to the nondegenerate tuple $(X_i|_x)$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Nonvanishing of the Fibrewise Denominators] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d6772616d2d7363686d6964742d64656e6f6d696e61746f7273\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%